From: Dj <43033058+DjDeveloperr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 02:34:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] nvme: apple: Add resident T6050 ANS over APIF

Add resident ANS queue support through APIF, including retained queue metadata, completion handling, and native SART ownership. Port the controller changes onto the current NVMe implementation while preserving the newer platform profiles.

Source snapshot: t6050-gpu ee68abb105200e99636a5edfc647a5cfc1d89954
Integration base: 9cbdd0734d9e186c5f5f5949a21b909d10c2571b

Signed-off-by: Dj <43033058+DjDeveloperr@users.noreply.github.com>
(cherry picked from commit 3883df4948fce7d9d4e712b0eb5bb51e436bf7f5)
